{
  "version": "0.4",
  "title": "RB / Mega Menu Panels (Products + Applications)",
  "type": "section",
  "notes": [
    "Place this section inside the header template, AFTER component-navbar.",
    "It holds two hidden panels that are revealed by hovering the matching top-level nav items.",
    "To wire a nav item to a panel:",
    "  1. In Appearance → Menus, edit the 'Products' (or 'Applications') menu item.",
    "  2. Open CSS Classes (enable via Screen Options if hidden) and add: has-rb-megamenu",
    "  3. In Link Relationship (XFN), add: #mm-products (or #mm-applications) — the anchor href attribute will be used as the trigger id.",
    "assets/js/megamenu.js handles hover/focus → .is-open."
  ],
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "mm-wrap",
      "elType": "section",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "full_width",
        "stretch_section": "section-stretched",
        "css_classes": "rb-megamenu-wrap",
        "padding": { "unit": "px", "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
        "position": "absolute",
        "_position_top": { "unit": "px", "size": 72 },
        "z_index": 800
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "mm-col-1",
          "elType": "column",
          "settings": { "_column_size": 100 },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "mm-products-widget",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "renobattery-mega-menu",
              "settings": {
                "trigger_id": "mm-products",
                "heading": "Products",
                "source": "taxonomy",
                "taxonomy": "product_cat",
                "max_tiles": 6,
                "columns": "3",
                "cta_text": "View all products",
                "cta_link": { "url": "/products/" },
                "bg_color": "#0A0A0A"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "mm-applications-widget",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "renobattery-mega-menu",
              "settings": {
                "trigger_id": "mm-applications",
                "heading": "Applications",
                "source": "taxonomy",
                "taxonomy": "application_cat",
                "max_tiles": 8,
                "columns": "4",
                "cta_text": "Explore applications",
                "cta_link": { "url": "/applications/" },
                "bg_color": "#0A0A0A"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    }
  ],
  "page_settings": []
}
